xfce4-terminal: View > Minimum Contrast toggle

New preference misc-minimum-contrast (default on) and a check item in
the View menu (also in the context menu's View Options) to switch VTE's
minimum contrast off and on for all terminals.  Needs a VTE with the
VteTerminal:minimum-contrast property (vte-0.84.1-min-contrast.patch);
it is looked up at runtime, so without it the item is just not shown.

Apply after xfce4-terminal-1.1.5-embedded-font.patch.

Commits (branch embedded-font on xfce4-terminal-1.1.5):
  7935f1a Add View > Minimum Contrast toggle

